<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan May fuel oil bunker prices unchanged.</title>
<headline>Taiwan May fuel oil bunker prices unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Chinese Petroleum Corp (CPC) has kept bunker fuel prices unchanged effective May 17, a company statement said on Monday.</p>
<p>Posted prices for 180, 280 and 380-centistoke bunker fuel delivered at the ports of Keelung, Hualien, Taichung and Suao were at $119 per tonne.</p>
<p>Term prices were also unchanged at $116 per tonne.</p>
<p>CPC is Taiwan's monopoly supplier of bunker fuels.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-8703082)</p>
</text>
